{
  "findings": [
    {
      "rule_id": "sql-injection",
      "severity": "error",
      "path": "src/login.js",
      "line": 8,
      "message": "SQL 查询通过字符串拼接构造：\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '\" + username + \"' AND active = 1\"。username 为外部输入且未做参数化处理，攻击者可传入 ' OR '1'='1 等载荷绕过条件或注入任意 SQL。应改用参数化查询/预编译语句（如 db.query(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ? AND active = 1\", [username])）。",
      "evidence": "const query = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '\" + username + \"' AND active = 1\";"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "hardcoded-secret",
      "severity": "error",
      "path": "src/login.js",
      "line": 13,
      "message": "源码中硬编码 API 密钥 SERVICE_API_KEY = \"sk-fixture-9f8e7d6c5b4a3f2e1d0c\"，会被提交进版本库并随包分发，导致密钥泄露。应从环境变量或密钥管理服务读取，并轮换已暴露的密钥。",
      "evidence": "const SERVICE_API_KEY = \"sk-fixture-9f8e7d6c5b4a3f2e1d0c\";"
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "xss",
      "severity": "error",
      "path": "src/render.js",
      "line": 6,
      "message": "用户可控字段 user.bio 未经转义直接赋给 innerHTML，形成存储型 XSS，可在页面中执行任意脚本。应改用 textContent 或经过转义/净化（如 DOMPurify）后再插入。",
      "evidence": "document.getElementById(\"profile\").innerHTML = user.bio;"
    }
  ]
}
```

